.TH "SCMAGCOPY" "1" "Sep 04, 2026" "7.4.0" "SeisComP"
.SH NAME
scmagcopy \- SeisComP Documentation
.sp
\fBCopies magnitudes to new origins referenced by events.\fP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.sp
scmagcopy is a \fISeisComP\fP module which copies a
\fI\%Magnitude\fP of a specific type, e.g., M(USGS), to an
\fI\%Origin\fP that has been associated to an
\fI\%Event\fP\&.
.sp
Processing steps performed:
.INDENT 0.0
.IP 1. 3
Listen for new origins associated to an event
(\fI\%OriginReference\fP).
.IP 2. 3
Check if the referenced origin already contains a magnitude of the configured
type and stop here if this is the case.
.IP 3. 3
Iterate through all origins and magnitudes of the corresponding event.
.IP 4. 3
Copy the latest magnitude of the configured type to the origin referenced by
the new origin reference just received.
.IP 5. 3
Send the magnitude copy to the messaging system.
.IP 6. 3
Let \fI\%scevent\fP decide whether the new magnitude becomes preferred.
.UNINDENT
.SH MODULE CONFIGURATION
.nf
\fBetc/defaults/global.cfg\fP
\fBetc/defaults/scmagcopy.cfg\fP
\fBetc/global.cfg\fP
\fBetc/scmagcopy.cfg\fP
\fB~/.seiscomp/global.cfg\fP
\fB~/.seiscomp/scmagcopy.cfg\fP
.fi
.sp
.sp
scmagcopy inherits \fI\%global options\fP\&.
